# Bao — how to work on this site

Read `MAINTENANCE.md` before changing code if the change is not obvious.

This site is an editorial workshop catalog, not an ecommerce. Commissions go through WhatsApp and email. There is no cart, checkout, auth, CMS or API.

## Attitude

- The smallest change that answers the request. Do not “take the chance” to redesign.
- If the user did not ask for a restyle, do not restyle.
- Keep routes, filters, contextual WhatsApp, product sheets, `inStock` and the narrative.
- When in doubt, do not invent sections, tokens or components.

## Forbidden

- Floating cards, shadows, glassmorphism, digital gradients, rounded-full
- WhatsApp green, pure white, pure black, shiny gold
- Blackletter, Inter, Poppins, Playfair, decorative icons
- Flags, folklore, medieval clichés or marketing “premium”
- Hardcoding prices, phones, photo paths or brand copy inside a component

## Where to edit

- Catalog and contact → `lib/data.ts`
- Photo paths and note slugs → `lib/content.ts`
- User-facing copy (ES / EN / RU) → `lib/i18n/es.ts`, `en.ts`, `ru.ts`
- Tokens → `tailwind.config.ts` (no loose hex)
- Ornament → only `components/brand/Ornament.tsx`

Concrete copy (“cut by hand”), never “quality and passion”.
